298809082"><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1726298901232" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1726298901232" data-resolution="3000x3000" style=""><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-right-sm gf-elm-right-xs gf-elm-right-lg" data-exc=""><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/acba7a37-2d17-43e5-be64-32f4d04b9a41/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/KAPOK%20KNOT_%E7%9D%80%E7%89%A9%E3%82%B3%E3%83%BC%E3%83%887406.jpeg" alt="" class="gf_image" data-gemlang="en" width="994" height="661" data-width="60%" data-height="auto" title="" natural-width="994" natural-height="661"></div></div></div></div><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1726803481782" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1726803481782" style="" data-extraclass=""><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-12 gf_col-md-12 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1726803481852" data-id="1726803481852"><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1726300136163" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="2" data-id="1726300136163" style=""><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-lg" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h1 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2"><u>Kimono Poncho Coat<span style="letter-spacing: 0px; text-align: inherit;">の</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0px; text-align: inherit;">裏テーマ</span></u></h1></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1726300173664" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1726300173664" style=""><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-lg" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px; text-align: inherit;">この着物